  ('milk-protein-concentrate', 'UIL-0064', 'Milk Protein Concentrate', 'MPC; concentrated milk protein; milk protein concentrate powder', 'Dairy proteins', 'Milk', 'Milk that has had much of its water, lactose and minerals removed while retaining casein and whey proteins in concentrated form.', 'Usually skimmed cow’s milk processed by filtration and drying.', 'Raises protein, improves texture, water binding and dairy flavour.', 'Processed ingredient', 'High-quality complete protein; amounts of lactose and minerals vary by concentration grade.', 'High.', 'Usually low to moderate depending on grade.', 'Variable; lower than ordinary milk powder in higher-protein grades.', 'Negligible.', 'Usually low to moderate depending on remaining lactose and the finished product.', 'Residual lactose can cause digestive symptoms in lactose intolerance; amount varies by grade.', 'No reliable evidence of unique inflammatory harm for most people; allergy is an immune reaction.', 'Milk allergen; may still contain lactose.', 'People with milk allergy; lactose intolerance; vegans.', 'High-protein yoghurt, cheese, bars, shakes, bakery foods and ready meals.', 'Milk protein concentrate; MPC 40/70/80/85; concentrated milk protein', 'Plain dairy foods or minimally processed protein sources where practical.', 'No', 'Yes', 'Gluten-free by composition; verify cross-contact.', 'Often associated with NOVA 3', 'Concentrated dairy protein', 'High', 'Must be declared as milk-derived.', 'A useful complete protein ingredient, but not equivalent across grades. Protein, lactose and fat depend on the specification.', 'milk protein concentrate|MPC|concentrated milk protein', 'milk protien concentrate', 'Milk protein isolate; skimmed milk powder; casein; whey protein', 'None inherent', 'https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/food-allergen-labelling-and-information-requirements-technical-guidance/food-allergen-labelling-and-information-requirements-technical-guidance; https://www.gov.uk/government/public