  ('alkalised-cocoa-powder', 'UIL-0238', 'Alkalised Cocoa Powder', 'Dutch-process cocoa; alkalized cocoa; treated cocoa powder; cocoa processed with alkali', 'Cocoa, coffee and tea derivatives', 'Cocoa powder', 'Cocoa powder treated with an alkalising agent to reduce acidity and change colour, flavour and dispersibility.', 'Cocoa beans plus a permitted alkalising process.', 'Adds darker colour, smoother cocoa flavour and improved mixing.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Provides cocoa solids, fibre and minerals; alkalisation can reduce some polyphenol content compared with comparable natural cocoa.', 'Moderate for a powder.', 'Low to moderate depending on residual cocoa butter.', 'Low in sugar when unsweetened.', 'Moderate to high.', 'Usually low when unsweetened; finished product matters.', 'Generally tolerated; caffeine, theobromine and acidity/reflux sensitivity remain individual.', 'No general inflammatory effect established.', 'True cocoa allergy is uncommon; cross-contact with milk, nuts or soya is product-specific.', 'People sensitive to caffeine/theobromine, reflux, migraines or cross-contact allergens.', 'Biscuits; cakes; ice cream; drinks; cereals; protein products; dark coatings.', 'Alkalised cocoa powder; cocoa processed with alkali; Dutch-process cocoa.', 'Natural unsweetened cocoa where a sharper flavour and less processing is preferred; recipe needs differ.', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Naturally gluten-free; check compound products', 'Usually NOVA 2', 'Processed cocoa ingredient; not automatically sweetened', 'High', 'Cocoa descriptions and composition rules may apply; alkalising agents and all other ingredients must be declared as required.', 'Alkalised cocoa is still cocoa, but it has been treated to change flavour and colour. The bigger issue is often the sugar and fat added around it.', 'alkalised cocoa powder; alkalized cocoa; dutch process cocoa; cocoa processed with alkali', 'alkalised coco; dutch processed cocao', 'Cocoa powder; cocoa mass; dark chocolate', 'Po