  ('breadcrumbs', 'UIL-0241', 'Breadcrumbs', 'Bread crumbs; dried breadcrumbs; fresh breadcrumbs; panko breadcrumbs', 'Bakery and cereal bases', 'Bread', 'Small particles of bread, used fresh or dried. Formulations vary and may include wheat flour, yeast, salt, oils, milk, egg, soya or seasonings.', 'Usually baked bread, most commonly wheat-based.', 'Adds coating, bulk, texture, binding and moisture control.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Mainly carbohydrate; contribution varies with bread recipe.', 'Usually low to moderate; higher if protein-enriched.', 'Usually low, unless oil or seeds are included.', 'Usually moderate to high starch contribution.', 'Usually low unless wholegrain or fibre-enriched.', 'Depends on portion, grain type and finished product.', 'Generally tolerated; wheat-based products may affect people with coeliac disease or wheat sensitivity.', 'No unique inflammatory effect established; assess allergens and overall formulation.', 'Commonly contains wheat/gluten; may also contain milk, egg, sesame or soya depending on recipe.', 'People with coeliac disease, wheat allergy or relevant food allergies.', 'Coated meat or fish, stuffing, burgers, gratins, toppings and baked foods.', 'Breadcrumbs; bread crumbs; panko; dried breadcrumbs', 'Wholegrain breadcrumbs or simple gluten-free crumbs where appropriate.', 'Formulation dependent', 'Formulation dependent', 'Usually contains wheat/gluten unless specifically gluten-free.', 'Context dependent', 'Amber — formulation-dependent compound ingredient', 'High', 'All component ingredients and regulated allergens must be declared where required.', 'Breadcrumbs are not one fixed ingredient. Check the bread base, allergens, salt and added oils rather than judging the name alone.', 'breadcrumbs|bread crumbs|panko|dried breadcrumbs|fresh breadcrumbs', 'breadcrums|bread crumbs', 'Bread; Wheat Flour; Wholemeal Flour', 'May contain emulsifiers, preservatives or raising agents depending on formulation.', 'https://www.gov.uk/go