  ('vanilla-paste', 'UIL-0265', 'Vanilla Paste', 'Vanilla bean paste; concentrated vanilla paste', 'Flavouring food ingredients', 'Vanilla', 'A thick vanilla preparation usually made from vanilla extract and/or ground vanilla beans combined with sugar, syrup, water and a thickener. Recipes vary widely.', 'Vanilla pods or extract plus carrier ingredients such as sugar syrup and gums.', 'Provides concentrated vanilla flavour and visible vanilla seeds in an easy-to-dose form.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Usually small amounts of sugar; used mainly for flavour rather than nutrition.', 'Negligible.', 'Usually negligible.', 'Often contains added sugar or syrup; amount depends on recipe and serving.', 'Negligible.', 'Small serving usually has limited impact, but sweetened formulations should not be treated as pure vanilla.', 'Usually neutral at culinary amounts; gums or sweeteners may affect sensitive people.', 'No established unique inflammatory concern at normal culinary use.', 'Vanilla is not one of the 14 regulated allergens; compound products may contain allergens or alcohol-derived extract.', 'People avoiding added sugar, alcohol-containing flavourings or specific thickeners.', 'Baking, desserts, yoghurt, ice cream, porridge and drinks.', 'Vanilla paste; vanilla bean paste; concentrated vanilla paste', 'Vanilla bean, unsweetened vanilla powder or pure vanilla extract depending on use.', 'Source dependent', 'Usually', 'Usually gluten-free; verify compound ingredients.', 'Often associated with NOVA 3', 'Amber — useful flavour, but recipe and added sugar vary', 'High', 'The product is a compound ingredient. Scanner should use the actual label rather than assume all vanilla pastes are equivalent.', 'Vanilla paste is convenient, but it is usually more than vanilla. Check whether the jar is mainly vanilla, sugar syrup and thickener.', 'vanilla paste|vanilla bean paste|concentrated vanilla paste', 'vanila paste|vanilla past', 'Vanilla Bean; Vanilla Extract; Vanilla Powder', '