  ('brown-sauce', 'UIL-0266', 'Brown Sauce', 'Brown condiment sauce; British brown sauce', 'Sauces, pastes and compound bases', 'Condiment Sauce', 'A dark, tangy compound condiment commonly made from vinegar, fruit or vegetable purée, sugar, molasses, spices, salt and starch. Recipes vary by brand.', 'Multiple plant ingredients and seasonings; may include barley malt vinegar.', 'Adds sweet, sour, spiced flavour and moisture to savoury foods.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Mostly small amounts of sugar and salt; little protein or fat.', 'Negligible.', 'Usually negligible.', 'Often contains added sugar, molasses or fruit concentrates.', 'Usually low.', 'Serving size is small, but sugar content varies and can accumulate with frequent use.', 'Acidic and spiced; may aggravate reflux or sensitive digestion in some people.', 'No meaningful judgement can be made from the generic name alone; formulation and amount matter.', 'Some products contain barley, gluten, celery or other regulated allergens; label checking is essential.', 'People limiting salt or sugar, with coeliac disease, reflux or specific allergies.', 'Breakfasts, bacon sandwiches, chips, burgers and marinades.', 'Brown sauce; brown condiment sauce', 'Lower-salt/lower-sugar versions, homemade tomato-based relish, mustard or herbs depending on use.', 'Check manufacturer', 'Usually', 'Varies; barley malt vinegar or other cereal ingredients may be present.', 'Context dependent', 'Amber/red — small-serving condiment, but sugar, salt and allergens vary', 'High', 'Treat as a compound product profile. Actual brand ingredients override this generic entry.', 'Brown sauce is a mixed condiment, not one ingredient. Check sugar, salt and whether barley or other allergens are hidden in the recipe.', 'brown sauce|brown condiment sauce|british brown sauce', 'browm sauce|brown sause', 'Tomato Ketchup; Malt Vinegar; Molasses', 'Modified starch, caramel colour, preservatives and flavourings may occur.', 'https://www.gov.uk/government/p