  ('white-breadcrumbs', 'UIL-0267', 'White Breadcrumbs', 'White bread crumbs; dried white breadcrumbs; fine white breadcrumbs', 'Bakery and cereal bases', 'Breadcrumbs', 'Crumbs made from white bread, commonly dried and milled. They usually contain refined wheat flour and may include yeast, salt, oil, milk, soya or other ingredients.', 'White bread, primarily refined wheat flour.', 'Coats foods; binds burgers and fillings; adds bulk, texture and browning.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Mainly refined carbohydrate; some protein and sodium; fibre is generally low.', 'Low to moderate, mainly wheat protein.', 'Usually low but depends on bread recipe.', 'High refined carbohydrate; some recipes contain added sugar.', 'Usually low.', 'Can raise blood glucose relatively quickly, especially in larger amounts.', 'Low fibre compared with wholemeal crumbs; gluten is relevant for coeliac disease.', 'No unique inflammatory effect established; refined-grain displacement and total diet matter.', 'Usually contains wheat/gluten; may contain milk, egg, sesame or soya depending on bread.', 'People with coeliac disease, wheat allergy or those increasing wholegrain intake.', 'Breaded foods, burgers, meatballs, stuffing, gratins and coatings.', 'White breadcrumbs; wheat breadcrumbs; dried breadcrumbs', 'Wholemeal breadcrumbs, oat-based crumbs where suitable, ground nuts/seeds or pulse crumbs depending on allergy needs.', 'Formulation dependent', 'Usually', 'Contains wheat and gluten unless specifically made and controlled as gluten-free.', 'Context dependent', 'Amber — useful binder, but refined and allergen-dependent', 'High', 'Wheat must be clearly declared and emphasised. Compound breadcrumb ingredients may need their own sub-ingredient list.', 'White breadcrumbs are mostly refined bread in dry form. They are useful for texture, but check wheat, salt and any extra milk, egg or soya.', 'white breadcrumbs|white bread crumbs|dried white breadcrumbs|wheat breadcrumbs', 'white bredcrumbs|white 