  ('beef-extract', 'UIL-0312', 'Beef Extract', 'Beef meat extract; beef extract powder', 'Meat and poultry ingredients', 'Beef', 'A concentrated beef-derived ingredient containing soluble meat components, usually used for flavour. Commercial specifications vary.', 'Beef material processed into an extract; supplier confirmation required.', 'Adds savoury beef flavour to stocks, sauces and formulated foods.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Variable soluble nitrogenous components and minerals; small use amounts may contribute little overall nutrition.', 'Not equivalent to a portion of beef or a standard protein isolate; peptide/protein content varies.', 'Often reduced or removed; commercial preparations can differ.', 'Pure extract and carrier-containing blends differ.', 'None inherent.', 'Depends mainly on other formulation ingredients; no generic benefit established.', 'No ingredient-specific digestive benefit established.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Beef is not one of the 14 regulated allergens; meat allergy or allergens in carriers/blends remain possible.', 'People with beef allergy, dietary exclusions or a need to check salt in the final product.', 'Stocks, bouillons, soups, sauces, gravies and savoury flavourings.', 'Beef Extract; Beef meat extract; beef extract powder', 'A suitable stock or plant-based savoury ingredient when needed; nutrition and flavour differ.', 'Not vegan', 'Not vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; blends, carriers and cross-contact must be assessed separately.', 'Context dependent', 'Meat flavour ingredient — specification and final recipe matter', 'Moderate', 'Declared name must match the actual material. The cited trade code is not UK law; compound products need their own ingredient/allergen assessment.', 'Beef extract mainly adds beef flavour. It does not automatically provide the nutrient profile or amount of protein in