  ('panko-breadcrumbs', 'UIL-0319', 'Panko Breadcrumbs', 'Panko; Japanese-style breadcrumbs; panko bread crumbs', 'Bakery and cereal bases', 'Wheat bread / dough', 'Light, flaky breadcrumbs usually made from a white wheat bread or dough preparation.', 'Usually wheat flour with recipe ingredients such as yeast, salt and sugar.', 'Adds crisp coating, binding or toppings.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Mostly starch with some wheat protein; fat, fibre and salt vary.', 'Some wheat protein; not a concentrated protein ingredient.', 'Depends on recipe and cooking; frying adds oil.', 'Usually predominantly starch.', 'Usually limited unless a specific wholegrain version is used.', 'Contains carbohydrate; portion and cooking/final meal affect response.', 'Wheat/gluten and recipe composition affect tolerance.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Usually contains WHEAT/gluten; egg, milk or other allergens can occur in some brands.', 'People with coeliac disease, wheat allergy or other recipe-specific allergies.', 'Coated foods, toppings, burgers, stuffing and gratins.', 'Panko Breadcrumbs; Panko; Japanese-style breadcrumbs; panko bread crumbs', 'Verified gluten-free crumbs if required; wholemeal crumbs where tolerated and appropriate.', 'Usually vegan', 'Usually vegetarian', 'Ordinary wheat panko contains gluten; verify specifically labelled gluten-free alternatives separately.', 'Context dependent', 'Cereal crumb ingredient — recipe and allergens matter', 'Moderate', 'Wheat and any other regulated allergens must be declared where required.', 'Panko provides a light crunchy coating. It is usually wheat-based; frying and the full recipe determine more than the breadcrumb name alone.', 'panko breadcrumbs|panko|japanese-style breadcrumbs|panko bread crumbs', 'None specifically validated; spelling corrections must not override exact ingredient/allergen matching.', 'Breadcrumbs; Wheat Crumbs