  ('rusk', 'UIL-0345', 'Rusk', 'Cereal rusk; wheat rusk; pinhead rusk', 'Bakery and cereal bases', 'Baked cereal dough', 'A baked and dried cereal ingredient sold as pieces or milled crumbs. Binder rusk and sweet eating rusks have different recipes.', 'Usually wheat flour with salt/raising ingredients; other ingredients depend on type.', 'Binds and absorbs water in foods; adds bulk, texture or a flavour carrier.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Mostly starch, with some cereal protein; fibre, fat, sugars and salt vary.', 'Some cereal protein; not a protein concentrate.', 'Recipe-dependent.', 'Usually the main contribution; sweetened rusks also contain added sugars.', 'Depends on the cereal and milling; not necessarily wholegrain.', 'Contains starch; sugar and serving size also matter.', 'Cereal/gluten and individual tolerance matter.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Ordinary wheat rusk contains WHEAT/gluten; milk, egg or other allergens can occur in some recipes.', 'People with coeliac disease, wheat allergy or other recipe-specific allergies.', 'Sausages, burgers, stuffing, coatings, seasoning carriers and some sweet baked foods.', 'Rusk; Cereal rusk; wheat rusk; pinhead rusk', 'Verified gluten-free binder/crumb if required; other substitutes depend on function.', 'Unknown', 'Unknown', 'Ordinary wheat rusk contains gluten; specifically gluten-free replacements must be assessed separately.', 'Context dependent', 'Cereal binder / baked ingredient — recipe and allergens matter', 'Moderate', 'Cereal source and other regulated allergens need declaration where required; assess the actual compound recipe.', 'Rusk adds starch, texture and water binding. The name does not tell you whether it is a simple binder or a sweetened baked product.', 'rusk|cereal rusk|wheat rusk|pinhead rusk', 'None specifically validated; spelling corrections must not override exact ingredient/allergen mat