  ('sparkling-water', 'UIL-0376', 'Sparkling Water', 'Carbonated water; fizzy water; water with carbon dioxide', 'Water and liquid bases', 'Water', 'Water containing naturally present or added carbon dioxide, which produces bubbles; this profile concerns plain unsweetened water.', 'Drinking, spring or mineral water with dissolved carbon dioxide.', 'Hydration and a carbonated liquid base.', 'Whole/minimally processed', 'Fluid; minerals and sodium vary by water source. Plain sparkling water contains no sugar.', 'None in plain sparkling water.', 'None in plain sparkling water.', 'None in plain unsweetened sparkling water.', 'None.', 'Plain sparkling water contributes no carbohydrate; sweetened or flavoured drinks require a separate ingredient assessment.', 'Fizzy drinks can cause belching or aggravate reflux/bloating in some people; personal tolerance varies.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'No inherent regulated allergen in plain sparkling water; flavoured or blended products are separate.', 'People whose reflux/bloating is triggered by carbonation; those with prescribed fluid or sodium restrictions should check the product.', 'Bottled sparkling waters and carbonated drink formulations.', 'Sparkling Water; Carbonated water; fizzy water; water with carbon dioxide', 'Still water if preferred or better tolerated.', 'Vegan', 'Vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; carriers, blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Usually NOVA 1', 'Hydration ingredient — carbonation and personal tolerance matter', 'Moderate', 'Natural mineral/spring-water descriptions and carbonation labelling have their own requirements; assess added flavourings, acids and sweeteners separately.', 'Plain sparkling water contributes to hydration without sugar. Bubbles and mineral content should be assessed separately from the ingredients in a flavoured or sweetened drink.', 