  ('mustard-powder', 'UIL-0377', 'Mustard Powder', 'Mustard flour; ground mustard seed; powdered mustard; dry mustard', 'Herbs, spices and seasonings', 'Mustard seeds', 'A dry ingredient made by milling mustard seeds or selected seed parts; prepared blends may include other ingredients.', 'Mustard seeds, including yellow/white and brown/oriental varieties; milling and dehulling vary.', 'Adds pungent flavour and can help binding/emulsification in sauces and seasoning blends.', 'Whole/minimally processed', 'Seed protein, fat and carbohydrate/fibre, but usually a small contribution at seasoning amounts.', 'Contains mustard-seed protein; ordinary seasoning amounts contribute little to total intake.', 'Contains seed oil unless specifically defatted; concentration depends on preparation.', 'Contains seed carbohydrate; added flour, starch or sugar can change composition.', 'Variable with dehulling and milling; not a guaranteed high-fibre ingredient.', 'Usually a small carbohydrate contribution at seasoning amounts; recipe and dose matter.', 'Pungent preparations can aggravate reflux symptoms in susceptible people; no general digestive-treatment claim.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Contains MUSTARD. Pure mustard flour is not wheat flour, but blends and cross-contact can add other allergens.', 'People with mustard allergy, or checking flour additions/cross-contact and personal reflux triggers.', 'Mustard condiments, spice mixes, sauces, dressings, pickles, meat rubs and prepared foods.', 'Mustard Powder; Mustard flour; ground mustard seed; powdered mustard; dry mustard', 'A suitable mustard-free seasoning for mustard allergy; choose the replacement for the intended flavour/function.', 'Vegan', 'Vegetarian', 'Pure mustard seed powder has no inherent gluten. Added wheat flour/starch or cross-contact require separate checks.', 'Context dependent', 'Mustard seed seasoning — mu