  ('potassium-enriched-salt', 'UIL-0378', 'Potassium-Enriched Salt', 'Potassium enriched salt; potassium-containing salt substitute; potassium salt blend', 'Salt and savoury bases', 'Salt blend / salt substitute', 'A salt product formulated with potassium salts, commonly replacing some sodium chloride with potassium chloride.', 'Food-grade mineral salts; sodium-to-potassium ratio and other ingredients vary.', 'Salty taste with potential sodium reduction when it replaces ordinary salt in a suitable formulation.', 'Processed culinary ingredient', 'Potassium and often sodium/chloride; actual quantities depend on the blend.', 'None in a plain mineral-salt blend.', 'None in a plain mineral-salt blend.', 'None in a plain mineral-salt blend.', 'None.', 'No direct carbohydrate contribution; this is not a blood-sugar treatment.', 'No fibre or established special digestive benefit.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'No inherent regulated allergen in the core mineral salts; additional blend ingredients need assessment.', 'People with impaired kidney function, high blood potassium or medicines that raise potassium should check suitability with their clinician/pharmacist before use.', 'Cooking/table salt substitutes and foods made with potassium-containing salt blends.', 'Potassium-Enriched Salt; Potassium enriched salt; potassium-containing salt substitute; potassium salt blend', 'Use less salt overall and add appropriate herbs/spices; select a salt substitute only when individually suitable.', 'Vegan', 'Vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; carriers, blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Usually NOVA 2', 'Potassium-containing salt — sodium replacement and individual suitability', 'High', 'Reduced-sodium claims require the relevant comparison/conditions. The term ''potassium-enriched'' does not define a fixed sodium reduction.', 'Potassium-enric