  ('pear-juice-concentrate', 'UIL-0380', 'Pear Juice Concentrate', 'Concentrated pear juice; pear concentrate (juice)', 'Fruit ingredients', 'Pear juice', 'Pear juice with part of its water removed, usually by evaporation; distinct from pear puree concentrate.', 'Juice pressed from pears, then concentrated; clarification and heat treatment vary.', 'Fruit flavour, sweetness, soluble fruit solids and efficient transport/storage.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Concentrated juice sugars and soluble solids; not equivalent to whole-pear fibre or nutrient content.', 'Generally a minor contribution.', 'Generally negligible in plain pear juice concentrate.', 'Main contribution is juice sugars, concentrated as water is removed; sugars count as free sugars.', 'Usually much less than whole pears; residual fibre varies with clarification/pulp content.', 'Juice sugars contribute to glycaemic load; amount, dilution and the full recipe matter. No fixed GI assigned.', 'No established special digestive benefit; do not assume the fibre contribution of whole pears.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Pear is not one of the 14 regulated allergens; individual fruit allergy, processing aids and blends still need assessment.', 'People monitoring free sugars/carbohydrate or managing diagnosed pear allergy.', 'Juice drinks, blended fruit products, bars, confectionery, sauces and sweetened formulations.', 'Pear Juice Concentrate; Concentrated pear juice; pear concentrate (juice)', 'Whole pears for a fruit portion, or a lower-sugar formulation for sweetening needs; puree and juice concentrate have different properties.', 'Usually vegan', 'Usually vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; carriers, blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Context dependent', 'Fruit-juice concentrate — free sugars and quantity matter', 'High', 'Juice/from-concentrate and nutrition-claim requ