  ('wheat-fibre', 'UIL-0382', 'Wheat Fibre', 'Wheat fiber; dietary wheat fibre; wheat stem fibre; wheat stem fiber', 'Cereal and grain derivatives', 'Wheat plant fibre', 'A wheat-derived fibre ingredient; refined stem fibre and grain/bran-derived preparations are not interchangeable.', 'Wheat plant material; some commercial ingredients are purified cellulose/hemicellulose from stems. Exact source and preparation must be confirmed.', 'Fibre enrichment, water binding, texture and bulking.', 'Refined ingredient', 'Primarily dietary fibre in concentrated preparations; residual starch, protein and minerals depend on processing.', 'Not a main protein ingredient; residual wheat protein depends on the preparation.', 'Usually little in refined fibre; obtain product data.', 'Dietary fibre is the main carbohydrate fraction in refined preparations; available carbohydrate must be verified.', 'Main intended contribution; fibre content and soluble/insoluble fractions are specification-dependent.', 'Fibre identity alone does not establish a low GI or a glucose-lowering benefit for the finished food.', 'Tolerance depends on amount and preparation. Wheat-bran or specific prebiotic evidence must not be transferred automatically to purified stem fibre.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Confirm wheat/cereal-allergen status from the exact source and processing. A gluten-free claim does not establish suitability for wheat allergy.', 'People with wheat allergy or coeliac disease need preparation-specific allergen and gluten information.', 'Fibre-enriched bakery products, snacks, meat/plant-based formulations and texture systems.', 'Wheat Fibre; Wheat fiber; dietary wheat fibre; wheat stem fibre; wheat stem fiber', 'A suitable, verified fibre ingredient selected for the intended function and dietary requirements.', 'Usually vegan', 'Usually vegetarian', 'Source-dependent. Some purified stem f