  ('buttermilk', 'UIL-0388', 'Buttermilk', 'Cultured buttermilk; churn buttermilk; liquid buttermilk', 'Dairy ingredients', 'Milk / cream', 'A milk-derived liquid: traditionally the liquid left after churning butter, or a cultured milk product sold as buttermilk.', 'Milk/cream and, for cultured forms, selected lactic cultures; fat content and preparation vary.', 'Tangy dairy flavour, moisture, baking functions and dairy nutrition.', 'Whole/minimally processed', 'Milk protein, lactose and calcium, with variable fat; not nutritionally equivalent to butter.', 'Contains dairy proteins supplying essential amino acids; amount depends on product.', 'Varies with milk/cream source and method; ''buttermilk'' does not define a fixed fat content.', 'Contains lactose unless specifically reduced/removed; fermentation does not automatically eliminate it.', 'None in a plain dairy preparation.', 'Lactose contributes carbohydrate; serving and any added sugar determine the food''s carbohydrate contribution.', 'Lactose may cause symptoms in susceptible people. Culture presence alone does not establish a probiotic benefit.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Contains MILK. Fermentation and churning do not make it suitable for milk-protein allergy.', 'People with milk allergy or lactose intolerance; those checking heat treatment, added ingredients or live-culture claims.', 'Baking mixes, breads/scones, pancakes, dressings, marinades, dairy drinks and prepared foods.', 'Buttermilk; Cultured buttermilk; churn buttermilk; liquid buttermilk', 'A recipe-appropriate tolerated dairy or plant preparation; lactose-free dairy only addresses lactose, not milk allergy.', 'Not vegan', 'Vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; carriers, blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Context dependent', 'Dairy ingredient with milk-allergen and lactose relevance', 'Moderate', 'MILK a