  ('beef-collagen', 'UIL-0390', 'Beef Collagen', 'Bovine collagen; bovine collagen protein; hydrolysed beef collagen; hydrolyzed beef collagen', 'Meat and poultry ingredients', 'Bovine connective-tissue protein', 'Collagen protein obtained from cattle tissues; native collagen, gelatine and hydrolysed collagen preparations differ.', 'Cattle connective tissues such as hide or bone; extraction, hydrolysis and purification vary.', 'Protein inclusion and preparation-dependent texture or nutrition-product functions.', 'Refined ingredient', 'Protein rich in glycine, proline and hydroxyproline; not equivalent to complete dietary protein.', 'Collagen lacks tryptophan and has an unbalanced essential-amino-acid profile; it must not be treated as a sole complete-protein source.', 'Usually limited in purified collagen preparations; blends differ.', 'No inherent sugar/starch in purified collagen; flavoured blends and carriers can add carbohydrate.', 'No dietary fibre; collagen is protein, not plant fibre.', 'No direct carbohydrate from pure collagen; no generic glucose-lowering claim assigned.', 'Generic beef collagen does not establish a gut-healing benefit; effects require preparation-specific human evidence.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Bovine collagen is not itself one of the 14 regulated allergens; individual animal-product allergy and added ingredients require assessment.', 'People avoiding animal products, checking bovine origin, or relying on it for their main protein intake.', 'Collagen supplements, nutrition powders/bars, drinks and protein/texture formulations.', 'Beef Collagen; Bovine collagen; bovine collagen protein; hydrolysed beef collagen; hydrolyzed beef collagen', 'Complete-protein foods or a varied diet for essential-amino-acid needs; texture replacements depend on the collagen preparation.', 'Not vegan', 'Not vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain i