  ('canola-protein', 'UIL-0392', 'Canola Protein', 'Rapeseed protein; canola protein isolate; canola protein concentrate', 'Plant proteins and meat alternatives', 'Canola / rapeseed', 'A protein-enriched ingredient obtained from canola/rapeseed, commonly through protein separation from oilseed material.', 'Food-grade canola/rapeseed seed material or defatted meal; protein fraction, extraction and authorised preparation vary.', 'Plant protein enrichment, emulsification, binding and texture.', 'Refined ingredient', 'Concentrated plant protein; residual fat, carbohydrate, fibre and minerals depend on preparation.', 'Main contribution; protein content, amino-acid balance and digestibility must be assessed for the exact product.', 'Often reduced by oil removal, but not assumed absent.', 'Residual carbohydrate and carriers vary; not nutritionally equivalent to whole rapeseed or canola oil.', 'Variable; a protein isolate is not automatically a fibre source.', 'No generic glucose-lowering benefit assigned; carbohydrate and the finished formulation determine the response.', 'No established generic prebiotic or gut-healing benefit.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Canola/rapeseed proteins may cross-react with MUSTARD allergy. Authorised rapeseed-protein preparations have specific mustard-allergy warning requirements.', 'People with mustard allergy should avoid assuming this is an allergen-free protein alternative; check the exact product and specialist advice.', 'Plant-based meat/dairy alternatives, protein products, bakery formulations and protein-enriched foods.', 'Canola Protein; Rapeseed protein; canola protein isolate; canola protein concentrate', 'Another suitable protein ingredient for the dietary/allergen requirements and recipe; no plant protein is automatically allergy-free.', 'Usually vegan', 'Usually vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; carrier