  ('rice-bran-fibre', 'UIL-0393', 'Rice Bran Fibre', 'Rice bran fiber; rice-bran fibre; rice-bran fiber', 'Fibres and prebiotic ingredients', 'Rice bran', 'A fibre-rich ingredient obtained from rice bran; whole bran, defatted bran and extracted fibre fractions can differ substantially.', 'Outer edible layers of rice grain; stabilisation, defatting and fibre extraction are preparation-specific.', 'Fibre enrichment, water binding, bulking and texture.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Dietary fibre with variable residual protein, starch, oil and minerals.', 'Residual protein depends on preparation; this is not necessarily a rice-protein concentrate.', 'Whole bran can retain oil; defatted/extracted fibre preparations usually contain less. Check the specification.', 'Fibre plus variable available carbohydrate/starch; extraction changes the fractions.', 'Main intended contribution; soluble/insoluble proportions and content require product data.', 'No fixed GI or generic glucose-lowering claim assigned to a broadly named fibre preparation.', 'Tolerance depends on dose and preparation; laboratory fibre-function findings do not establish a specific human prebiotic benefit.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Rice is not one of the 14 regulated allergens; individual rice allergy and blend/cross-contact allergens remain relevant.', 'People needing verified gluten-free handling, diagnosed rice allergy, or preparation-specific fibre information.', 'Fibre-enriched bakery products, snacks, nutrition formulations and texture/binding systems.', 'Rice Bran Fibre; Rice bran fiber; rice-bran fibre; rice-bran fiber', 'A suitable food-fibre ingredient or whole fibre-containing foods, according to the intended use and tolerance.', 'Usually vegan', 'Usually vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; carriers, blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Context dependent', 'R