  ('cocoa-fruit-pulp', 'UIL-0394', 'Cocoa Fruit Pulp', 'Cacao fruit pulp; cocoa pulp; cacao pulp; cocoa fruit mucilage', 'Cocoa, coffee and tea derivatives', 'Cocoa fruit pulp', 'The pale, moist, mucilaginous pulp surrounding cocoa seeds inside the pod; distinct from cocoa beans and pod husk.', 'Theobroma cacao fruit pulp separated from husks and beans; food-grade treatment and form vary.', 'Fruit flavour, sweetness and a liquid/pulp base in foods and drinks.', 'Whole/minimally processed', 'Water and naturally occurring sugars, with preparation-dependent soluble solids and fibre.', 'Not generally a main protein source.', 'Not nutritionally equivalent to cocoa butter or cocoa-bean fat.', 'Sugars are the main available carbohydrate; juice/concentrate form and sweetening use need separate free-sugar assessment.', 'Varies with pulp, juicing and filtration; do not transfer cocoa-bean or cocoa-shell fibre figures.', 'Sugar amount, serving, dilution and the complete food determine the response. No fixed GI assigned.', 'No established generic prebiotic or gut-healing benefit.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Cocoa fruit is not one of the 14 regulated allergens; individual allergy, blends and cross-contact require checks.', 'People monitoring sugars/carbohydrate or needing a verified food-grade pulp preparation.', 'Fruit drinks, ice creams, desserts, fruit preparations and cocoa-fruit formulations.', 'Cocoa Fruit Pulp; Cacao fruit pulp; cocoa pulp; cacao pulp; cocoa fruit mucilage', 'Another suitable fruit preparation for the recipe, or a lower-sugar formulation where desired; flavour and solids differ.', 'Vegan', 'Vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; carriers, blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Context dependent', 'Cocoa-fruit preparation with sugar and form-dependent relevance', 'Moderate', 'GB lists authorised traditional cocoa pulp/