ing recipe assessment', 'Moderate', 'Assess component ingredients and all relevant allergens; generic biscuit-crumb wording does not establish a uniform nutritional or dietary profile.', 'Biscuit crumb carries the ingredients of the biscuit it came from. Its sugar, fat, gluten, allergens and vegan suitability need assessment from the full recipe.', 'biscuit crumb|biscuit crumbs|crushed biscuits|cookie crumbs|crumbled biscuits', 'None specifically validated; spelling corrections must not override exact ingredient/allergen matching.', 'Biscuits; Digestive Biscuit Crumb; Biscuit Flour; Breadcrumbs; Cheesecake Base', 'Raising agents, emulsifiers, flavourings or other additives may be inherited from the biscuit recipe; no universal list assigned.', 'https://www.britishbakels.co.uk/products/digestive-biscuit-crumb/ | https://www.lotusbiscoff.com/en-gb/foodprofessionals/products/biscoff-cookie-crumbs-750-g | https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/food-allergen-labelling-and-information-requirements-technical-guidance/food-allergen-labelling-and-information-requirements-technical-guidance | https://www.gov.uk/food-labelling-and-packaging/ingredients-list', '2026-10-14', '{}'::jsonb),
  ('probiotic-culture', 'UIL-0398', 'Probiotic Culture', 'Probiotic cultures; live probiotic culture; probiotic bacteria culture', 'Cultures and fermentation ingredients', 'Live microorganism preparation', 'A preparation described as probiotic; qualifying health effects require identified live strains, suitable amounts and supporting evidence.', 'Cultivated bacteria and/or yeasts with a product-specific carrier system; species, strains and preparation are unspecified here.', 'Adds selected live microorganisms to foods or supplements for an intended, evidence-dependent benefit.', 'Additive/functional ingredient', 'Usually little direct macronutrient contribution; carriers and the finished formulation determine composition.', 'Usually negligible directly; milk/protein carriers may be present.', 'Usually negligible directly; the preparation and food recipe need assessment.', 'Sugars or starch may be used as carriers; assess the actual product.', 'Not automatically a fibre or prebiotic ingredient; these are separate identities.', 'No generic glucose-lowering benefit assigned without strain/product-specific human evidence.', 'Benefits depend on strain, amount, condition and population. The generic name alone is insufficient to assign a proven gut-health outcome.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Carriers may contain MILK, SOYA or cereal ingredients; check the complete preparation and any relevant allergen residues.', 'People with weakened immunity or serious illness should seek clinical advice before concentrated probiotic use; allergen and viability information also matter.', 'Selected fermented foods, fortified products, cultured dairy/plant products and probiotic supplements.', 'Probiotic Culture; Probiotic cultures; live probiotic culture; probiotic bacteria culture', 'A product with evidence for the relevant strains, amount and purpose where use is appropriate; no uni