  ('maple-sugar', 'UIL-0514', 'Maple Sugar', 'Granulated maple sugar; pure maple sugar; maple sap sugar', 'Sugars, syrups and sweetening ingredients', 'Crystallised maple sweetener', 'Sugar produced by further concentrating maple sap/syrup and forming sugar crystals or a solid sugar product.', 'Maple sap processed through syrup concentration and further evaporation/crystallisation; pure and blended products differ.', 'Sweetness and characteristic maple flavour in dry or baked foods.', 'Processed culinary ingredient', 'A concentrated sugar ingredient; variable minor maple components do not make it a replacement for nutrient-rich whole foods.', 'Not a meaningful protein source.', 'Usually little fat in pure maple sugar.', 'Predominantly sugars, which count as free sugars.', 'Not a meaningful fibre source in the pure sweetener.', 'Count its sugars within the recipe; maple origin does not establish a glucose-treatment or sugar-free benefit.', 'No established gut-treatment effect assigned.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'No UK-regulated allergen inherent in pure maple sugar; assess blends, flavours and relevant cross-contact.', 'People monitoring free sugars and anyone distinguishing pure maple sugar from maple-flavoured sugar blends.', 'Baking, confectionery, dry drink mixes, toppings and sweet seasoning.', 'Maple Sugar; Granulated maple sugar; pure maple sugar; maple sap sugar', 'A less-sweet recipe where appropriate, or another sweetener matched to texture; switching sugar types does not automatically reduce free sugars.', 'Vegan', 'Vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Usually NOVA 2', 'Concentrated culinary sugar requiring purity and portion context', 'High', 'Pure-maple and nutrition claims must reflect the actual product. Maple-flavoured sugar with other sugars or flavourings needs an accura