  ('soured-cream', 'UIL-0518', 'Soured Cream', 'Sour cream; dairy sour cream; cultured sour cream', 'Dairy ingredients', 'Soured dairy cream', 'Dairy cream with a sour taste, commonly produced using a bacterial culture. Formulation, acidity method and heat treatment vary.', 'Dairy cream soured with the specified culture or process, with possible stabilisers or other additions.', 'Tangy flavour, richness and creamy texture.', 'Processed culinary ingredient', 'Provides milk fat, including saturated fat, plus some milk protein and lactose; fat level and recipe vary.', 'Contains milk protein; not a concentrated protein ingredient.', 'Milk-fat contribution depends on the grade and portion.', 'Can retain lactose; fermentation does not establish lactose-free status.', 'None inherent in plain dairy soured cream.', 'No glucose-treatment benefit assigned; assess lactose and added sugars where present.', 'Lactose tolerance and culture viability depend on the product. Cultured does not automatically establish a probiotic treatment benefit.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Contains MILK, a regulated allergen. Souring does not make ordinary cream suitable for milk allergy.', 'People with milk allergy or lactose intolerance, and anyone checking fat content, heat treatment or added ingredients.', 'Dips, dressings, sauces, baking, desserts and savoury accompaniments.', 'Soured Cream; Sour cream; dairy sour cream; cultured sour cream', 'A verified suitable milk-free preparation for milk allergy; check its own allergens and recipe performance.', 'Not vegan', 'Vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Context dependent', 'Soured dairy ingredient requiring milk and formulation context', 'High', 'Declare and emphasise milk. Live-culture, lactose-free and nutrition claims require the actual product evidence.', 'Soured cr