  ('free-range-egg', 'UIL-0519', 'Free-Range Egg', 'Free range egg; free-range eggs; free range eggs', 'Egg ingredients', 'Whole hen egg', 'A hen egg produced under an applicable free-range farming system. The description concerns production conditions and does not itself specify a superior nutrient level.', 'Laying hens in a verified free-range production system; feed, flock management and certification details require confirmation.', 'Whole-egg protein, emulsification, binding, foaming, colour and richness.', 'Whole/minimally processed', 'Supplies egg protein, yolk fat and micronutrients. Feed and other factors can affect composition; free-range alone does not establish an amino-acid or vitamin advantage.', 'Contains egg protein; no universal higher-protein or amino-acid claim follows from free-range.', 'Yolk supplies fat, phospholipids and cholesterol; feed and portion matter.', 'Usually little carbohydrate in plain whole egg.', 'None in plain egg.', 'No glucose-treatment benefit assigned.', 'No established gut-treatment effect assigned to the farming description.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Contains EGG, a regulated allergen. Free-range does not remove egg-allergy relevance.', 'People with egg allergy and anyone preparing raw or lightly cooked eggs; assess quality scheme, species and official handling advice separately.', 'Shell eggs, bakery, desserts, mayonnaise, pasta and other egg-containing foods.', 'Free-Range Egg; Free range egg; free-range eggs; free range eggs', 'A suitable egg-free recipe for egg allergy; other farming systems or bird species do not establish allergy safety.', 'Not vegan', 'Vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Usually NOVA 1', 'Whole-egg ingredient with a production-system descriptor', 'High', 'Free-range is subject to applicable egg-marketing rules. Mandator