  ('vegetable-stock', 'UIL-0534', 'Vegetable Stock', 'Vegetable broth; vegetable bouillon; veg stock', 'Salt and savoury bases', 'Compound vegetable savoury base', 'A vegetable-based savoury stock, supplied as liquid, concentrate, cube or another preparation with variable ingredients.', 'Vegetables, water or concentrated extracts, often with salt, fats, starches, yeast extract, herbs or flavourings.', 'Savoury flavour and cooking liquid in soups, sauces, gravies and meals.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Composition and dilution determine energy, salt and nutrients; dry concentrate and prepared broth values are not interchangeable.', 'Not automatically a meaningful protein source; check actual composition.', 'Added oils or fats vary by recipe.', 'Starch, sugars and vegetable solids may contribute carbohydrate.', 'Often limited in diluted stock; not equivalent to whole vegetables.', 'No fixed glycaemic index or glucose-treatment benefit; assess actual carbohydrate and portion.', 'No established probiotic or gut-treatment benefit from a stock name.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'CELERY is common but not universal. WHEAT, SOYA, MILK or other allergens may occur in particular recipes; check the full formulation.', 'People checking allergens, salt, dietary suitability or concentrate dilution.', 'Soups, sauces, gravies, risottos, prepared meals and savoury cooking.', 'Vegetable Stock; Vegetable broth; vegetable bouillon; veg stock', 'A suitably assessed homemade stock or another stock preparation; salt, allergens and concentration differ.', 'Usually vegan', 'Usually vegetarian', 'Vegetable stock is not inherently gluten-free; cereal ingredients, flavourings and finished-product compliance require checking.', 'Context dependent', 'Compound savoury base; recipe and dilution matter', 'Moderate', 'Declare required recipe allergens and give/use the appropriate preparation basis fo