  ('cream-powder', 'UIL-0570', 'Cream Powder', 'Powdered cream; dried cream; dairy cream powder; sweet cream powder', 'Dairy ingredients', 'Dried dairy cream ingredient', 'A dried dairy ingredient made from cream or a specified cream/milk blend; fat level and other ingredients vary.', 'Milk-derived cream processed and dried, sometimes with milk solids, carriers or other formulation ingredients.', 'Cream flavour, fat, body and convenient dry incorporation in foods.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Concentrated dairy components; fat, lactose, protein and carriers depend on the specification and reconstitution.', 'Contains milk proteins; not equivalent to a standard protein concentrate.', 'Often a substantial fat contribution, including saturated fat; actual grade determines the amount.', 'Residual lactose and any carbohydrate carriers contribute; not automatically lactose-free.', 'Plain dairy material supplies little or no fibre; any added fibre needs separate identification.', 'No fixed glycaemic index or glucose-treatment benefit; assess lactose, carriers and use level.', 'Drying does not establish a probiotic product or improved lactose tolerance.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'MILK: drying does not remove milk-allergen relevance. Lactose intolerance and milk allergy need separate assessment.', 'People with milk allergy or lactose intolerance and those checking carriers, fat content and dry-versus-reconstituted values.', 'Dry soup and sauce mixes, bakery, confectionery, desserts and beverage formulations.', 'Cream Powder; Powdered cream; dried cream; dairy cream powder; sweet cream powder', 'A suitable liquid cream or plant-based preparation; allergens, fat and reconstitution behaviour differ.', 'Not vegan', 'Usually vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Context dependent', 'Dried dairy ingredient