  ('chicken-breast', 'UIL-0572', 'Chicken Breast', 'Chicken breast meat; breast of chicken', 'Meat and poultry ingredients', 'Chicken breast muscle meat', 'The breast cut of chicken; skin, bone, added water and preparation need confirmation.', 'Chicken breast muscle, supplied skinless or with skin/bone and processed further only as specified.', 'Protein, meat texture and flavour in meals and poultry preparations.', 'Whole/minimally processed', 'Provides protein with fat and other nutrients; skin, added ingredients, water content and cooking affect values.', 'Provides protein containing indispensable amino acids; no fixed amino-acid amount follows from the cut name.', 'Usually relatively limited in plain skinless breast; retained skin and added fats change the profile.', 'Little carbohydrate in plain breast meat; coatings, sauces or marinades can add it.', 'Plain meat does not supply dietary fibre.', 'No fixed glycaemic index or glucose-treatment benefit; assess the complete dish.', 'No established probiotic or gut-treatment benefit from the plain cut.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Chicken allergy is possible although outside the UK 14 allergens. WHEAT, EGG, MILK or other allergens can occur in coatings or prepared recipes.', 'People with relevant allergies or checking brines, marinades and coatings; safe handling and cooking matter.', 'Prepared meals, salads, sandwiches, cooked poultry dishes and other meat preparations.', 'Chicken Breast; Chicken breast meat; breast of chicken', 'Another suitable protein food; nutrients, allergens, texture and cooking requirements differ.', 'Not vegan', 'Not vegetarian', 'No inherent gluten in the plain ingredient; blends and cross-contact need separate assessment.', 'Usually NOVA 1', 'Poultry cut; assess skin and added ingredients', 'High', 'Verify the actual meat preparation and required labelling; handle and cook poultry safel