  ('hydrolysed-potato-protein', 'UIL-0574', 'Hydrolysed Potato Protein', 'Hydrolyzed potato protein; potato protein hydrolysate; potato protein peptides', 'Plant proteins and meat alternatives', 'Potato-derived protein hydrolysate', 'Potato protein broken into smaller peptides and amino acids; composition and functionality depend on the starting material and hydrolysis process.', 'Potato-derived protein subjected to specified hydrolysis and further separation or drying; enzyme origin and food grade need confirmation.', 'Potential protein and formulation functions, including studied emulsifying/foaming properties; suitability depends on the actual preparation.', 'Highly refined ingredient', 'Potato-derived peptides and protein with grade-dependent purity, residual components and carriers.', 'No fixed protein percentage, amino-acid profile, complete-protein serving or absorption advantage follows from the generic name.', 'Residual fat depends on the starting material and purification.', 'Residual starch, sugars or carriers depend on the grade.', 'Not equivalent to whole-potato fibre.', 'No fixed glycaemic index or glucose-lowering benefit established by the name.', 'Hydrolysis does not establish hypoallergenicity, improved tolerance or a gut-treatment benefit.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Potato allergy is possible although outside the UK 14 allergens. Residual proteins, enzymes and carriers require assessment; hydrolysis does not guarantee allergen removal.', 'People with potato allergy and anyone checking food-grade evidence, manufacturing enzymes, carriers or protein composition.', 'Specified protein/formulation materials where a documented food-grade preparation is supplied; actual intended use needs confirmation.', 'Hydrolysed Potato Protein; Hydrolyzed potato protein; potato protein hydrolysate; potato protein peptides', 'Another suitably assessed protein ing