  ('smoke-condensate', 'UIL-0577', 'Smoke Condensate', 'Smoke flavouring condensate; smoke flavoring condensate; condensed smoke flavouring; condensed smoke flavoring', 'Flavouring food ingredients', 'Smoke-derived flavouring preparation', 'A smoke-derived mixture collected by condensation and processed for a specified flavouring use; the generic term does not identify the authorised primary product.', 'Specified source material and smoke-generation/condensation process, with purification, fractions and carriers defined by the food-grade preparation.', 'Smoke flavour in food applications where the exact primary product and use are permitted.', 'Additive/functional ingredient', 'Normally a flavouring-level contribution; carrier, concentration and amount determine any nutrient contribution.', 'Not a standard protein serving; assess any protein-containing carriers.', 'Carrier oils or emulsions can contribute fat; not specified by the name.', 'Sugars, other carriers or solids vary by preparation.', 'Not a dietary-fibre ingredient by this name.', 'No fixed glycaemic index or glucose-treatment benefit.', 'No established probiotic or gut-treatment benefit; smoke flavour is not evidence of fermentation.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'Check source materials, carriers and the complete formulation for regulated allergens; the generic term does not establish allergen-free status.', 'Consumers checking smoke flavourings following safety reassessments, and food businesses verifying the exact product''s current market permissions.', 'Specified sauces, seasonings, meat/fish or cheese preparations and other foods where the exact use is permitted.', 'Smoke Condensate; Smoke flavouring condensate; smoke flavoring condensate; condensed smoke flavouring; condensed smoke flavoring', 'A flavour system suitable and permitted for the intended food; traditional smoking and other smoke prepa