  ('fermented-wheat-flour', 'UIL-0579', 'Fermented Wheat Flour', 'Cultured wheat flour; fermented flour (wheat)', 'Bakery and cereal bases', 'Fermented wheat-derived ingredient', 'Wheat flour or a wheat-derived preparation fermented with selected microorganisms; active dough starters, dried ferments and preservation-oriented preparations differ.', 'Wheat material subjected to a defined fermentation process, with optional drying, heat treatment or added carriers.', 'Flavour, acidity, dough functionality or specified preservation functions, depending on the preparation.', 'Processed ingredient', 'Flour components and fermentation products vary by process and inclusion level; no fixed nutrient profile applies.', 'Contains wheat proteins; ordinary fermentation does not automatically remove allergenicity.', 'Usually limited in plain flour-derived material; recipe-dependent.', 'Residual cereal starch/sugars and fermentation products depend on the process.', 'Depends on flour refinement and retained grain material.', 'No universal glycaemic index or glucose-lowering benefit follows from fermentation.', 'Fermentation does not establish improved tolerance, viable organisms at consumption or a probiotic benefit.', 'No inflammation rating assigned: this generic profile does not establish an inflammatory or anti-inflammatory effect in people.', 'WHEAT: a regulated cereal allergen containing gluten. Media, carriers or added ingredients can introduce other allergens.', 'People with wheat allergy or coeliac disease, and anyone checking whether the product is an active starter, dried ferment or functional ingredient.', 'Bakery, dough formulations and specified fermented-wheat ingredient systems.', 'Fermented Wheat Flour; Cultured wheat flour; fermented flour (wheat)', 'A suitable fermented-flour or formulation system for the intended function; gluten, allergens and preservation behaviour differ.', 'Source-dependent', 'Source-dependent', 'Wheat-derived gluten remains relevant; ordin